                      バッファが生成された直後。このイベントは、\n                                ++hidden オプションによってウィンドウなしに\n                                バッファが生成された場合でも発生する。\n```","ts":"1633446150.208600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fafb2d34-d7f6-48fa-b3b0-7ab085ddca2b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":":h TerminalOpen","ts":"1633446149.208500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kh7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eae75238-ba1e-400e-b3e3-5b5ae841f7ef","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"動いてない気がする…","ts":"1633446136.208100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bi+p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5366c74-abb4-4bc3-89c1-e47c66f461f4","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```augroup my-floaterm\n  autocmd!\n  autocmd TerminalOpen * nnoremap \u0026lt;buffer\u0026gt; \u0026lt;nowait\u0026gt; \u0026lt;F10\u0026gt; a\naugroup END```\nうーん…","ts":"1633446127.207900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dBx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac2fcd02-3f21-4fed-8ddf-4ddc5e6d5259","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"今はリネームされたのでいけますね","ts":"1633477340.226200","thread_ts":"1633473490.224800","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oVL51"}]}]
